audio-compare (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Security: track URIs are passed to GStreamer as values, never parsed as
    pipeline syntax.
  * Security: file analysis is bounded in memory and length (4 h cap, stall
    timeout) and runs on a worker thread, so long files no longer freeze the
    window; closing a pane cancels its analysis.
  * Security: release toolchain pinned and verified; build split from publish.
  * Fix a deadlock when tearing down a failed track's branch.
  * macOS: global menu bar with standard shortcuts and native window controls.

 -- mmxgn <mmxgn@users.noreply.github.com>  Wed, 18 Nov 2026 11:51:20 +0000

