audio-compare (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * macOS support: Nix and Homebrew builds, self-contained .app and .dmg.
  * Audio engine fixes: float mix with -12 dB headroom, sample-accurate
    seeking and switching, polarity inversion, failed-track handling,
    per-channel loudness, no hang on undecodable input.

 -- mmxgn <mmxgn@users.noreply.github.com>  Sun, 15 Nov 2026 12:29:32 +0000

